      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAVE AGENDA (4) is the obvious favourite after three straight wins, the latest over TURN BIRD, and her BM70 win at Townsville adds substance to the streak; the question is her return to 1250m, where she has placed but not won. TURN BIRD (1) is a danger with a head second to BRAVE AGENDA over 1450m at this track backed up by a half-length third at Townsville on soft ground. He is proven at this track and distance, handles wet ground and looks well placed to convert a string of placings. INCHING CLOSER (5) has been plain at his past two, including a last of six at Gordonvale, but four wins and five placings from 18 starts at this track and distance keep him a rougher winning hope if he returns sharper. OVERLORD (3) cannot be discounted third-up.",
